# Whisk & Crumbs Identity and Quiet Bakery Backgrounds

Status: DONE
Milestone: M8 Singular display identity published with the twelve-cake notebook and verified live
Dependencies: 08_READABILITY_AND_SIMPLE_ORDERING.todo, 09_STORY_AND_CAKE_STICKERS.todo, 11_PALETTE_READABILITY_AND_PUBLISHING.todo

## Purpose

Apply the user's chosen Whisk & Crumbs display name throughout the existing
website, with original whisk/crumb artwork and understated bakery outlines.
Preserve the cream/deep-green design, accessible ordering and real cake sources.
Name selection is not a brand-availability, legal-uniqueness or trademark finding.

