## Acceptance criteria

- [x] New display branding is consistent; rendered HTML escapes '&' as '&amp;'.
- [x] The retired exact display brand is absent from active rendered HTML, not erased from history.
- [x] Actual Instagram routing and the configurable WhatsApp option are preserved.
- [x] Logo PNG is wider than 900px with transparent edges; icon sizes match their declarations.
- [x] Pure SVG patterns contain no image/text/script/animation or filled motifs.
- [x] Raster guards enforce max alpha <=22/255, stroke contrast <=1.25:1 and coverage <=6%.
- [x] Six viewports and 200% text checks preserve readable text, visible navigation and contact controls.
- [x] Current build contains 124 allowlisted files; nine brand assets match the new private hash receipt.
- [x] Reference pixels, original photographs, manifests, private reviews and docs are not published.
- [x] Full-page visual inspection for the new identity is recorded.
- [x] The new release succeeds for the exact commit and its live files are verified.
- [x] Native-app/device/assistive-technology acceptance, business facts and hosting risk remain explicit.
- [x] Display-name approval is not represented as trademark or brand-availability clearance.

